  "readLevelSimple": "Simple — as before",
  "readLevelMedium": "Medium (default)",
  "readLevelHigh": "High",
  "readLevelUltra": "Ultra",
  "readLevelInfo": "How many networks read each block of English text (times on a slow laptop without a graphics card, the reading of a page alone; finding the text and preparing small text come on top):\n• Simple — as before: PP-OCRv5. About 1 s.\n• Medium — PP-OCRv6 small reads too (21 MB, already there for Chinese and Japanese); of the two readings of a block, the one with more real English words is kept. About 2 s.\n• High — after Medium, the PaddleOCR-VL network reads again the blocks where either fast reader found a word missing from the dictionary (about half). Nearly Ultra, faster: about 7 s per such block, 30 s per page on average (about 1 min for a manga screenshot).\n• Ultra — PaddleOCR-VL reads every block: best of all on full comic pages. About 7 s per block, 1 min per page on average (up to 3 min).\nPaddleOCR-VL is a separate download (1.8 GB, Apache-2.0 licence) and takes about 2.5 GB of memory; the first block after starting takes 10–20 s longer, a huge block of a wall of text up to 2 min. Until it is there, High and Ultra work as Medium.\nOther languages are read as on Simple.",
  "inpainter": "Text removal",
  "cleanLevel": "Text removal quality",
  "cleanLevelSimple": "Simple — as before",
  "cleanLevelMedium": "Medium",
  "cleanLevelHigh": "High (default)",
  "cleanLevelCustom": "Custom combination",
  "cleanLevelInfo": "How text is removed from the page (times on a slow laptop without a graphics card, per page on average):\n• Simple — as before: a mask by the algorithm with a margin around the letters, repainted by the AOT network. About 4 s.\n• Medium — the comic-text-detector network finds the letters themselves and AOT repaints only them: the drawing next to the text is hardly touched, 2–4 times fewer letter remains. About 6 s.\n• High — the same, repainted by LaMa: best on grey screentone and drawings. About 7 s, plus 8 s on the first run. Large pages take longer (up to 15–20 s).\nWhite bubbles are filled at once, without a network, on every level. comic-text-detector is a separate download (82 MB, GPL-3.0 licence); until it is there, the mask of Simple is used.",
  "hdStrategy": "Cleaning large pages",
